;; Ported from OCaml 5.5.0 (the release tarball https://caml.inria.fr/pub/distrib/ocaml-5.5/ocaml-5.5.0.tar.xz, SHA-256
;; fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba): parsing/lexer.mll (its rules token, directive,
;; comment, string and quoted_string with ocamllex's longest match, earliest rule first; its helpers; the token function
;; that files docstrings), the parts of stdlib/lexing.ml it relies on (the positions a match updates) and utils/misc.ml's
;; Utf8_lexeme (Latin-9 identifiers, their NFC normalization), whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;             Xavier Leroy, projet Cristal, INRIA Rocquencourt
;;
